  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When requesting an invite to a friend in an Invite Only (or Friends Only) let the sender know if the creator of the instance can invite you or not.\n\nLike, if my friend is in a Friends Only world, where i don't have the host of the instance in my friends list from, let me know that i don't have them on my friends list, so i won't be able to join.\n(Maybe let me know the name of the user who created the instance, just a maybe)\n\nor when my friend is in an Invite Only (not Invite+) and i request an invite off of them, but the instance isn't hosted by them, let me know about it, and give them the option to forward it to the instances creator to invite me instead, so i won't bother my friend with invites when i try to send them, but aren't aware of them being in an instance i simply can't join cause of Friends Only (when i don't have the creator of the instance as a friend) or invite Only (when my friend didn't create the instance themselves).",
